{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "148", "x": 0.8949472934591233, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03879595514451251, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Audio scripts", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12320988416665674, "w": 0.19736274036078327, "h": 0.02614255646024867, "c": 1, "size": 18.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Part 1", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19068361951547927, "w": 0.06881167324518032, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): I've been meaning to ask you for some advice about", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.21901404503240193, "w": 0.8262175632832715, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "restaurants. I need to book somewhere to celebrate my sister's 30th birthday. And", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.24734439510653955, "w": 0.8261205746769721, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I liked the sound of that place you went to for your mom's 50th.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.27571186303090783, "w": 0.6520615512661165, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): The Junction. Yeah, I definitely recommend that for a special", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3040422131050455, "w": 0.826266672736144, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "occasion. We had a great time there. Everyone really enjoyed it.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33237254431848684, "w": 0.6522631153252968, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): Where is it again? I can't remember.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3607029698354095, "w": 0.5842828681929967, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): It's on Grayson Street, only about a 2-minute walk from the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3890333199095471, "w": 0.8266408888175315, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "station.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.41721534946833205, "w": 0.08591224602133975, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): Oh, that's good. I'd prefer not to have to drive anywhere, but", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4455457372638622, "w": 0.8260820252943415, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "I don't want to have to walk too far either.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.47390083257148696, "w": 0.43169267263382405, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Yes, the location's perfect, but that's not necessarily why I'd", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5022311826456246, "w": 0.8261633275827087, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "recommend it. The food's amazing. If you like fish, it's probably the best restaurant", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5305615704411547, "w": 0.8261785012758718, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in town for that. It's always really fresh, and there are lots of interesting dishes to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5588919205152924, "w": 0.8261643528322468, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "choose from, but all the food is good there.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5872223083108224, "w": 0.44600433598534633, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): Is it really expensive?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6155526961063525, "w": 0.4405618500750944, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): It's certainly not cheap, but for a special occasion, I think it's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6438830461804902, "w": 0.8259938538340693, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "fine. It's got a great atmosphere, and before dinner, you can go up on the roof and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6722505141048585, "w": 0.8259466923553191, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "have a drink. It's really nice up there, but you need to book. It's very popular as the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7005808641789961, "w": 0.8261643528322468, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "views are spectacular.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7289112896959188, "w": 0.23673867916896962, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): Sounds good. So, that's definitely possibility. Then is there", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7572416397700564, "w": 0.8262498586437199, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "anywhere else you can think of?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7855719898441941, "w": 0.3359122716525782, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): Um, if you want somewhere a bit less formal, then you could", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8139023399183317, "w": 0.8261637376825239, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "try Paloma. Speaker 1 (Woman): Where's that? I haven't heard of it.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8422326899924693, "w": 0.6831036979418013, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Friend): No, it's quite new. It's only been open a few months, but it's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8705878607428791, "w": 0.8260346587656836, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "got a great reputation already. It's in a really beautiful old building on Bow Street.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.898769890301664, "w": 0.8323007788923266, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Woman): Oh, I think I know where you mean. Right beside the cinema.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9271002403758016, "w": 0.8262535495420569, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}], "source": "pdf text layer"}